B.aV4=new A.CH(1500,1080,400,!0,"c41","First Strike","A rival citadel squats across the field. Raise a Roost and let your fighters raze it.",0,4,1500,0,500,318,22,1200,800,B.Ok,16,"A Roost births fighters that march on the enemy base all by themselves \u2014 you never steer them. Each fighter costs minerals, so keep the Roost powered and the ore flowing.")
B.aV5=new A.CH(2600,1120,410,!1,"c42","Crossfire","They raid while you besiege. Hold the line at home and keep the fighters marching.",0,4,2600,0,480,326,26,1240,820,B.Ok,-1,"Defend while you push: raids keep coming for the whole siege. Split your minerals between guns at home and fighters for the front \u2014 a dead economy loses both battles.")
