B.daW=new A.q("deleteHistory",B.W,'logdelete-1008: opt-in no-data-loss mode for the \u22ee Delete text / Delete item options. Each delete first snapshots the entry (or the whole deleted subtree) into a "revision_of" record in edgesTable (empty from, to = the entry; never a containment edge, so it renders nowhere), and the UI offers Restore (stub button / toast). Default false: deletes are undoable only via board undo.',B.f,null)
