B.bKk=s(["radial"],t.s)
B.d8s=new A.q("autoArrange",B.C,'Opt-in root-level auto-layout for a bubble with no stored posColumn value yet: "radial" arranges ROOT bubbles in overlap-avoiding concentric rings sized from bubbleSize, instead of the plain per-index ring fallback \u2014 so the map opens tidy. Nested bubbles keep auto-orbiting their parent either way. Re-runnable on demand via the `bublArrange` action (wire a "Tidy" button/menu item to it). Absent \u2192 unchanged per-index ring fallback.',B.bKk,null)
B.d7r=new A.q("tapMenu",B.U,"Opt-in: a plain bubble TAP opens a menu sheet listing these items instead of firing onTap directly \u2014 [{label, icon?, action}, ...] (same shape as swipeActions' object entries). Selecting an item fires its `action` spec with the tapped bubble's id+table merged in, same as onTap. Absent/empty \u2192 today's direct-tap behavior, unchanged.",B.f,null)
B.dj1=new A.q("chainThemes",B.U,'List of "#RRGGBB" hexes. Every bubble with no explicit fill (fillColorColumn/fillColorMap still win) is tinted by the theme of its chain root, picked by that root\'s id. Absent/empty = unchanged palette fallback.',B.f,null)
