B.dqJ=new A.q("scopeMatch",B.bC,'Opt-in scope MATCH MODE, only meaningful alongside scopeColumn. "pathContains" treats scopeColumn\'s value as a materialized-path string and matches when it contains the active scope value wrapped in slashes (shows bubbles at any depth, not just an exact id match). Absent = plain equality.',B.bJl,null)
