B.djn=new A.q("dock",B.bC,"Where the controls dock around the body. auto (default) = side panel on wide surfaces; on phones every dock becomes a floating button PILL (bottom-center, raised clear of the OS gesture zone) that opens the controls as a HALF-height draggable sheet \u2014 the content stays partially visible; drag the sheet's top handle to expand, close via \xd7, downward fling, or barrier tap.",B.bvh,null)
B.deY=new A.q("sheetLabel",B.C,'Label for the phone pill + the region header (default: the localized engine builtin "Data controls"); may be a {lang: text} map.',B.f,null)
B.dos=new A.q("body",B.U,"The board content the controls dock around (a node spec). Omit to render just the control strip.",B.f,null)
B.drq=new A.q("children",B.U,"Explicit control-block node specs (default: filter + group + sort for `table`).",B.f,null)
B.doR=new A.q("blocksTable",B.ay,'Opt-in table of USER-ADDED control-block rows (columns: id, kind [filter|group|sort|range|segment|search], column?, label?, order). When set, the dock gains an "Add control" affordance (+ button) and a per-block remove (\xd7); blocks render from these rows AFTER the static `children`, through the SAME datafilter/datagroup/datasort/datarange/datasegment/datasearch node builders.',B.f,null)
B.bF3=s([B.doW,B.djn,B.deY,B.dos,B.drq,B.doR],t.G)
B.cU9=new A.d8("datacontrols",'The dockable DATA CONTROLS region \u2014 the databoard spine\'s face. Hosts control blocks (children; default = datafilter + datagroup + datasort for `table`) docked around `body`. Controls publish to the board-level shared data config; any view with configSource:"board" subscribes, so filters/grouping/sort persist across chart, table and map representations.',B.bF3,!1)
