B.cUA=new A.d8("datasegment","CONTROL block: one-tap VALUE CHIPS for a low-cardinality column (scenario/status switch). Multi-select; each tap toggles that value in the shared choice filter; none selected = no constraint. Hides itself when the column is not segment-shaped.",B.bwY,!1)
