B.dfw=new A.q("play",B.W,'Opt-in play button (default off) that advances the clock by `playStepMinutes` every `playIntervalMs`, so acts light up and expire as the day rolls past. Also raises the same shared "dataset playing" signal databars\' play does, so a map with markerPulse breathes while the clock runs.',B.f,null)
