B.diO=new A.q("viewToggle",B.W,"Two-level: show a Tree/Cards toggle in column 1. Tree = the nesting directory outline; Cards = a Finder-column card browser of the current level (tap a card selects it \u2014 its tasks open in the column to the side \u2014 and a dropdown/dropup chevron peeks its children inline). Off = tree only (unchanged).",B.f,null)
