B.diS=new A.q("leafChildKinds",B.U,'Sub-leaf tree: child kindColumn values of a LEAF shown nested under it in the tasks column (e.g. ["task"] = sub-tasks). Other children (the leaf\'s log) stay out of the rails. Leaf \u22ee menus gain a create-sub-leaf item.',B.f,null)
B.d8D=new A.q("leafAttachmentKinds",B.U,'Child kindColumn values of a LEAF shown as TERMINAL attachment leaves under it (e.g. ["wireframe","docs","image"]): no expand chevron, and a tap opens the item full-screen. Unlike leafChildKinds these never descend \u2014 lets a task\'s attachments appear in the directory tree.',B.f,null)
