B.dqz=new A.q("addItems",B.U,'Extra typed "New <x>" actions beyond New file: [{label, icon, values}] \u2014 each stamps values on the new leaf (e.g. {kind:"doc"}); shown as one "New" menu. An entry may instead give {label, icon, action:{fn,args}} (e.g. Mokup\'s "New from template", firing instantiateTemplate) \u2014 the action fires directly and no leaf is created here, for an action that mints its own root row. `action` wins over `values` if an entry has both.',B.f,null)
