B.dn1=new A.q("shareAware",B.W,"Opt-out (default true): when the host has wired a ShareInfoProvider/AccessResolver (project sharing), this explorer shows the share people-chip + accent stripe and honors capability gating on add/rename/delete/drag. Set false to exempt this explorer even when the host's hooks are wired globally. Inert when the host wires no hooks.",B.f,null)
