B.dkt=new A.q("titleMaxLines",B.ah,"Ceiling on how many lines a leaf row TITLE itself may wrap to (default 2, minimum 1) \u2014 independent of previewLines, which still governs the comment preview below it. A narrow tree column can set this to 1 so a row stays a compact title + single preview line instead of stacking a 2-line title on top of a multi-line preview.",B.f,null)
B.dfv=new A.q("itemViewOnCreate",B.W,'Adding a new leaf opens the read-only item view (title autofocused, comment placeholder) instead of the classic auto-"Rename" popup; abandoning it with both fields still blank deletes the row outright instead of leaving it "Untitled". Folders are unaffected \u2014 they keep the Rename prompt.',B.f,null)
