B.d7p=new A.q("projectOverview",B.W,"Opt-in PER-PROJECT overview dashboard \u2014 a third Tasks \u21c4 Overview segment in column 2's (contents) header, alongside the existing detailedView Directory/Detailed toggle. Off by default so no existing applet's UI changes. When on, selecting a project can switch its contents column to a computed bar/pie breakdown of every item in that project's contains-subtree. See overviewTagsColumn/overviewTypeColumn for the two breakdown columns.",B.f,null)
B.dm0=new A.q("valueLabels",B.U,"Opt-in raw-value \u2192 display map for rendered DATA VALUES (tree row status/tag chips, the projectOverview by-status/by-tag/by-type chart bucket labels): {raw: text-or-{lang:text}} or column-keyed {column: {raw: ...}}, resolved against the ambient locale; unmapped values render exactly as before (passthrough, never blank). Display-only \u2014 stored values, filter payloads and tag `colors` keys stay RAW.",B.f,null)
B.diJ=new A.q("overviewTagsColumn",B.v,"projectOverview: the multi-value (List<String>) column the overview's \"by tag\" bar chart buckets on \u2014 each item can carry more than one tag, so every tag it holds counts once in that tag's bucket (a scalar column works too; each row then counts once under its own value). Unset hides the tag breakdown.",B.f,null)
