B.d7H=new A.q("linksTable",B.ay,"Enables Obsidian-style `[[Title]]` wiki-links: an auto-maintained link-row index in this table (add/remove/update on every save), tappable resolved-link spans in Preview (writes `sel:<table>` \u2014 pair with an explorer's `followSelection` to jump there), and a `[[` title autocomplete while typing. Unset (default) \u2192 zero behavior change. If a merge (or any external write) ever leaves two linksTable rows with the same resolved title for the same FROM note, the sync keeps the FIRST row in table order and reaps the rest \u2014 deterministic, not arbitrary.",B.f,null)
